{{- /*
  base.gohtml renders every full notify admin page through infodancer/ui's
  Layer 2 ui/document, so the chrome (nav, footer, meta, CSS, analytics, theme,
  sidebars) is owned by ui and skinned per request by the host via Config.Chrome.
  The page supplies the {{define "content"}} block; the notify chrome partial
  supplies the title/head blocks; the embedded ui.DocumentData on the view
  supplies ui/document's chrome fields.
*/ -}}
{{ template "ui/document" . }}
